--- text
Changes to the [PRODUCT_NAME] terms of service

We are changing the terms of service that govern your
[PRODUCT_NAME] account. What is changing: [CHANGE_SUMMARY]. The new
terms take effect on [EFFECTIVE_DATE] and apply to your account
from that date.

In plain words, these are the changes that affect you:

- [LIST_ITEM_1]
- [LIST_ITEM_2]
- [LIST_ITEM_3]

That list is a summary. It leaves things out, and it is not the
agreement. The full terms of service govern your account, and where
the summary and the full terms differ, the full terms apply. Read
them before [EFFECTIVE_DATE].

Read the terms of service:

[TERMS_URL]

If you do not agree

You do not have to accept the new terms. If you do not want them to
apply to you, stop using [PRODUCT_NAME] and close your account
before [EFFECTIVE_DATE]. Export your data first, because a closed
account cannot be opened again.

You can export your data and close the account in your account
settings. If the account is still open on [EFFECTIVE_DATE], the new
terms apply to it.

Open account settings:

[SECONDARY_URL]

This email is a notice about the terms that govern your account. It
is not a marketing message, and there is nothing to unsubscribe
from.

If any part of this is unclear, reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
